# `dankg check` can verify the design record's own cross-references (and,
# once `src/` starts converting, links from a decision to the code that
# implements it) never go stale silently -- the actual payoff behind
# converting `architecture.org`/`project.org` to `.md` in the first place.
#
# `[lang.*]`/`[tangle.*]` sections are added here as `src/` modules
# actually convert; nothing under docs alone needs either yet.
